# SpotMap UX
- Map-first layout; list/map sync; mobile-first PWA; clear Wakesurf/Cable filter state.
- Distinct installation pins on zoom; cluster only when zoomed out; don't confuse park vs installation count.
- Show unknown/pending/verified states explicitly. No fake ratings, photos, opening hours or weather.
- A card should lead to route/contact or save; explain match/rating rather than show unexplained magic numbers.
- Build accessible, responsive screens with empty, loading, offline and error states.
